---
// Template only. Have a lawyer review before you sell anything.
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Terms of Service" description={`The terms that govern use of ${site.name}'s website and digital products.`}>
  <h2>1. Agreement</h2>
  <p>These Terms of Service govern your use of this website and any courses, playbooks, templates, workshops, or other digital products offered here (together, the "Services"), operated by {site.legalEntity} ("we", "us"). By using the Services you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Services.</p>

  <h2>2. Use of the website</h2>
  <p>You may browse and share links to this website for personal and professional purposes. You agree not to misuse the Services, interfere with their operation, attempt to access them through automated means at a disruptive volume, or use them for anything unlawful.</p>

  <h2 id="purchases">3. Purchases and refunds</h2>
  <p>Prices are listed in US dollars and may change at any time before purchase. Payment is handled by third party processors, and we do not store your full card details.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Self paced courses, playbooks, and template kits may be refunded within 14 days of purchase if you are not satisfied, by emailing {site.email}.</li>
    <li>Live workshops may be refunded up to 7 days before the first session. After that, you may transfer your seat to a future cohort.</li>
    <li>Refunds may be declined where a product has been substantially downloaded or consumed in a way that suggests abuse of this policy.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. License to digital products</h2>
  <p>When you buy a product you receive a personal, non transferable, non exclusive license to use it for your own learning and for internal use within your business. You may not resell, redistribute, publicly share, or repackage the materials. Team and organization licenses are available on request.</p>

